# Only for the minified build the instrumented tests run against.
#
# The test APK leaves out the libraries it shares with the app and calls the app's copies, and it calls some of
# our code that the app itself never does (openScore, constructors with default arguments). R8 would remove all
# of that. test-references.keep, next to this file, keeps exactly what the tests reference, generated by
# scripts/trace-test-references.sh. Everything else is shrunk, merged and inlined as in release.
